    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>The illusionist can spend 1 point from his veil pool to create an illusory double of himself as a move action. This double functions as a single mirror image, and lasts for a number of rounds equal to his illusionist level, or until the illusory duplicate is dispelled or destroyed. He can have no more than one copycat at a time. This ability does not stack with the mirror image spell.</p>",
